# This file is generated by dune, edit dune-project instead
opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis: "HTTP/1.1 protocol stack for OxCaml"
description: """
A bounded-buffer HTTP/1.1 parser and serializer built on OxCaml's unboxed
types and local allocations, with OxCaml-native RFC 3986 URI and RFC 6570 URI
Template implementations. Separate Findlib libraries provide URI operations,
typed media codecs with bounded JSON and Markdown support, shared
Eio TLS, Punycode, the Public Suffix List, and HTTP cookies."""
maintainer: ["anil@recoil.org"]
authors: ["Anil Madhavapeddy"]
license: ["MIT" "ISC" "MPL-2.0"]
homepage: "https://github.com/avsm/httpz"
bug-reports: "https://github.com/avsm/httpz/issues"
